  "claim": "The 2010 comedy film, first released in European cinemas, about five friends reuniting for a holiday weekend starred at least one previous cast member from \"Saturday Night Live\". This movie also starred Joyce Van Patten.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Grown Ups (film). Sentence: Grown Ups is a 2010 American comedy film directed by Dennis Dugan and stars Adam Sandler, Kevin James, Chris Rock, David Spade and Rob Schneider.\nPage: Grown Ups (film). Sentence: It depicts five friends of a high school basketball team reuniting for a holiday weekend after learning of the passing of their coach.\nPage: David Spade. Sentence: He rose to fame in the 1990s as a cast member on \"Saturday Night Live\", then began a successful acting career in both film and television.\nPage: David Spade. Sentence: He also starred and co-starred in the films \"Tommy Boy\", \"Black Sheep\", \"Joe Dirt\", \"\", \"Grown Ups\", and \"Grown Ups 2\", among others.\nPage: Joyce Van Patten. Sentence: Among many roles, one of her most recognized is that of the wise, elderly wife of Rob Schneider's character in the Adam Sandler comedy \"Grown Ups\" (2010).",
