        "original_id": "e510e875-b005-58df-8b91-4dbca3bd8135",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dennis Dugan, Adam Sandler, Kevin James, Chris Rock, David Spade, Rob Schneider, Joyce Van Patten\n- Works: Grown Ups, Grown Ups 2, Saturday Night Live, Tommy Boy, Black Sheep, Joe Dirt\n- Topics: film careers, comedy films, plot premise\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1990s, David Spade rose to fame as a cast member on Saturday Night Live and then began a successful acting career in film and television.\n- Grown Ups is a 2010 American comedy film directed by Dennis Dugan and starring Adam Sandler, Kevin James, Chris Rock, David Spade, and Rob Schneider.\n- Grown Ups depicts five friends from a high school basketball team reuniting for a holiday weekend after learning that their coach has died.\n- David Spade starred or co-starred in the films Tommy Boy, Black Sheep, Joe Dirt, Grown Ups, and Grown Ups 2.\n- In Grown Ups, Joyce Van Patten played the wise, elderly wife of Rob Schneider's character, and this is one of her most recognized roles.",
